#. <CLT 4>電気スタンドだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the desk lamp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>この事件と関わりはないよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It has no connection to my investigation, though...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>電気スタンドだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's the desk lamp.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木箱の中身は…空のままだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The wooden box...is still empty.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>まあ、事件には関係なさそうだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Well, it has nothing to do with the case this time,\n"
"anyway...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>木箱の中身は…空のままだ。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The wooden box...is still empty.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これがすべて、未解決事件の捜査報告書か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>These are a bunch of investigation reports related to\n"
"different cold cases.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、今回の事件には関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that has nothing to do with my investigation this\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>これがすべて、未解決事件の捜査報告書か…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>These are a bunch of investigation reports related to\n"
"different cold cases.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ボクが関わるべき事じゃないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It doesn't seem all that useful right now...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“真の支配者層”についての資料…
#. 一般人が触れてはいけない世界の真実…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a document about the \"secret council\" revealing\n"
"the kind of truth a commoner shouldn't go near...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>でも、今回の事件には関係ないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But that has nothing to do with my investigation this\n"
"time...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>“真の支配者層”についての資料…
#. 一般人が触れてはいけない世界の真実…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a document about the \"secret council\" revealing\n"
"the kind of truth a commoner shouldn't go near...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>…やめておくべきだよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0014 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>So I guess I'd better not.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 大統領暗殺の…真実…
msgctxt "0015 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The truth behind...a presidential assassination..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、命を狙われるなんてごめんだ…
#. 見ない方がいいな。
msgctxt "0016 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if it means someone comes after *me*? Nope. I'll\n"
"leave it where it is, thank you very much."
msgstr ""

#. 今回の事件にも、関係なさそうだし…
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Plus, it doesn't seem to have any connection to my\n"
"investigation right now."
msgstr ""

#. 大統領暗殺の…真実…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "The truth behind...a presidential assassination..."
msgstr ""

#. でも、命を狙われるなんてごめんだ…
#. 見ない方がいいな。
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"But if it means *I* become a target? Nope. I'll leave\n"
"it where it is, thank you very much."
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0020 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0021 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>書庫から出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0022 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the archive?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
